      "revision": 1374379517,
      "text": "Artocarpus gomezianus is a tree in the family Moraceae and a wild species of the breadfruit or jackfruit genus (Artocarpus); it may be referred to as the 'sampang' and its Vietnamese name is mít chay. It is native to tropical Asia, from Assam through Indo-China to Peninsular Malaysia, Sumatra, Java, and the Philippines in Malesia."
